# To fix the "requested action is invalid" error on Vercel or other custom domains:
# 1. Create a free Firebase project at https://console.firebase.google.com/
# 2. Enable Authentication (Google Provider) and Firestore Database
# 3. Add your Vercel domain to Authorized Domains in Firebase Authentication settings
# 4. Copy your Firebase project settings and add them as Environment Variables in Vercel:

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_api_key
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_sender_id
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_app_id
VITE_FIREBASE_DATABASE_ID=(default)
